      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Route switch contract",
      "items": [
        "Direct and Circuit converge at the same Station identity and canonical ingress.",
        "Automatic replay is allowed only for SafeRead or explicitly idempotent requests."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Generation fence",
      "items": [
        "Route replacement invalidates stale RouteLease, grants and private permits.",
